      "writtenOn": "2017-10-03T10:38:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For operators which use default apn as initial attach apn, which is open for edit, and if user deletes that apn, then initial attach request would be sent with the next available apn. In such cases, lte attach would fail with wrong apn. This check would make sure to block initial attach requests with apns other than default and ia type.",
