      "writtenOn": "2017-12-07T23:05:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I actually agree with Jaya that his looks like a workaround. If the user deletes the APN that supports IA/default that mess up the configuration, I think failing initial attach should be expected. If the operator does not want users to modify/delete the APN, we can mark the APN as read-only so deleting APN would not possible.",
      "parentUuid": "7fd0ca79_b7b40f43",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2081,
