        "id": 1141163
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-09-26T21:02:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am not getting why this change is needed. Is the issue seen if there is a IA APN configured as well for the SIM card mcc/mnc ? \n\nTelephony gets the APNs based on the SIM card IMSI mcc/mnc so wondering why telephony needs to wait for all records to be loaded ?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2312,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 2314,
        "endChar": 9
      },
      "revId": "e6e2ffd5695ad2d5162625f452b1f1fe138454c0",
